1️⃣ Data model (minimal + future-proof)

Add this to your Player model:

export interface HltvTop20Entry {
  year: number;      // e.g. 2024
  rank: number;      // 1–20
}

export interface Player {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  // ... all your existing fields

  hltvHistory?: HltvTop20Entry[]; // optional, historical only
}


Example player data:

